      <div>
        <p><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-140567-140627"><seg source="#source-140567-140585">ぐろきしにあ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-140627-140669">つかみつぶせばしみじみとから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-140669-140690"><rb>紅</rb><rt>くれなゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-140690-140715">のいのち忍ばゆ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-140715-140727">時計の針</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-140727-140780"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-21" source="#source-140730-140768">Ⅰ</g></rb><rt>いち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-140780-140783">と</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-21" source="#source-140783-140821">Ⅰ</g><seg source="#source-140821-140827">とに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-140827-140842"><rb>来</rb><rt>きた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-140842-140894">るときするどく君をおもひつめにき</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-140894-140969" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
