      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-141332-141407">あかんぼを黒き猫来て食みしといふ恐ろしき世にわれも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-141407-141422"><rb>飯</rb><rt>いひ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-141422-141434"><rb>食</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-141434-141441">む</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-141441-141459">犬が啼き居り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-141459-141483"><rb>乾草</rb><rt>ほしぐさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-141483-141550">のなかにやはらかく首突き入れて犬が啼き居り</seg></p>
